blocks.en:
SNO-PI is built around this asymmetry. Its contributions are:
(i) a recall-first linking pipeline in which curated terminology enters at every stage;
(ii) a staged training recipe (clinical MLM → \rightarrow SNOMED pre-training → \rightarrow task fine-tuning) that
lets cross-encoders learn concepts they never see labelled;
and (iii) an analysis of where scarcity still bites, including note-level variation in annotation conventions.

blocks.zh:
SNO-PI是围绕这种不对称性构建的. 其贡献是:
(一) 第一次召回连接的管道,每个阶段都输入整理术语;
(二) 分阶段培训菜谱(临床MLM ~ 右手的 SNOMED 前期培训 ~ 右手的任务微调)
让交叉编码者学习他们从未见过标签的概念;
(iii) 分析稀缺仍在何处受到侵袭,包括注释公约中的注级差异。
